*5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
