==Strategy==
Spamming Area Attackers like [[Cameraman Cat]] wins this stage very easily. You can also rush this stage with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] by using the first Pigeon as a cash deposit.

